note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note moe_maps32 at wide capacity: logical ulong maps (X at 0, Y at 1416) to u32 maps.
note Output bytes X at 0, Y at 1416*4. Unused output bytes untouched.
note Validate every active value before writing; caller retains map capacity/generation lease.
fn mw_m32 out edit uchar 11328 p ulong v ulong to void
for b ulong 4
put out add mul p 4 b uchar and shr v mul b 8 255
end
end
fn moe_maps32_wide m view ulong 8 mp view ulong 2832 out edit uchar 11328 to ulong
if gt get m 0 1408
ret 1
end
n = add get m 0 8
for z ulong 2
for i ulong n
if gt get mp add mul z 1416 i 4294967295
ret 2
end
end
end
for z ulong 2
for i ulong n
p = add mul z 1416 i
mw_m32 out p get mp p
end
end
ret 0
end
